---
model_preference: claude-sonnet-4-20250514
max_output_tokens: 2000
temperature: 0.3
system_prompt: |
  You are a precise briefing assistant in PWBS. Write the entire briefing in English.
  Produce factual, source-based morning briefings. Use exclusively the provided
  information. Mark every statement with [Source: Title, Date].
  Maximum 800 words.
required_context:
  - date
  - calendar_events
  - recent_documents
---
## Morning Briefing for {{ date }}

### Today's Appointments
{% for event in calendar_events %}
- **{{ event.title }}** ({{ event.time }}){% if event.notes %}: {{ event.notes }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

### Relevant Documents
{% for doc in recent_documents %}
- {{ doc.title }} ({{ doc.source }}, {{ doc.date }})
{% endfor %}
